WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.682 --> 00:00:04.270
- (chuckles) You got me.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.187
(explosion blasts)

00:00:08.136 --> 00:00:13.136
This is not meth.

00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:18.554
(explosion blasts)

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.977
(intense music)

00:00:51.578 --> 00:00:54.543
(Hank breathing heavily)

00:00:54.543 --> 00:00:56.800
- Schrader, where you goin'?

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.783
- We need a evidence bag.

00:01:00.903 --> 00:01:02.620
(men laughing)

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.880
- What's the matter, Schrader?

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.770
You act like you've never
saw a severed human head

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:07.480
on a tortoise before!

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:10.063
(men laughing)

00:01:18.891 --> 00:01:20.514
- Hey, welcome to--

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:23.431
(explosion blasts)

00:01:30.605 --> 00:01:33.272
(intense music)

00:01:45.173 --> 00:01:48.756
(metal scraping on ground)

00:01:54.418 --> 00:01:57.751
(Hank grunting in pain)

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:10.177
(gunshot fires)

00:02:12.603 --> 00:02:15.603
(car alarm blaring)

00:02:20.862 --> 00:02:23.445
(Jane choking)

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.723
- To W.W, my star, my perfect sun.

00:03:42.584 --> 00:03:46.423
W.W, who do you figure that is?

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:48.573
Woodrow Wilson?

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:50.783
Willy Wonka?

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.493
Walter White?

00:03:57.617 --> 00:04:00.853
- (chuckles) You got me.

00:04:20.313 --> 00:04:22.896
(bell dinging)

00:04:28.492 --> 00:04:29.325
(Gus screams)

00:04:29.325 --> 00:04:32.094
(explosion blasts)

00:04:32.094 --> 00:04:34.761
(alarm blaring)

00:04:41.865 --> 00:04:43.532
- [Woman] Oh, Jesus.

